{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange virus has torn your body apart \u2014 literally. Your goal is simple: find every missing piece and put yourself back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In single-player, you\u2019ll make your way through ten challenging levels filled with traps, shifting platforms, and virus-driven obstacles. Each fragment you recover makes you stronger and brings you one step closer to feeling whole again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer, things get chaotic.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag Mode</strong> turns survival into a race \u2014 chase, infect, and escape before the clock runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reassemble Mode</strong> is a desperate scramble to rebuild yourself before someone else takes you out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fragment matters. Every move could be your last. Can you survive the virus and reassemble yourself before it\u2019s too late?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083150?t=1760412357","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083150?t=1760412357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083150/4e40e56915f4ea27785085d9cd1b4534c5a52dfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760412357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083150/4e40e56915f4ea27785085d9cd1b4534c5a52dfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760412357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains moderate violence and gore, including dismemberment, blood, and mutated characters caused by a virus. Some scenes may be unsettling to sensitive players, but the content is not excessively graphic. Players should be aware of body horror and survival elements in the storyline."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange virus has torn your body apart \u2014 literally. Your goal is simple: find every missing piece and put yourself back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In single-player, you\u2019ll make your way through ten challenging levels filled with traps, shifting platforms, and virus-driven obstacles. Each fragment you recover makes you stronger and brings you one step closer to feeling whole again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer, things get chaotic.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag Mode</strong> turns survival into a race \u2014 chase, infect, and escape before the clock runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reassemble Mode</strong> is a desperate scramble to rebuild yourself before someone else takes you out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fragment matters. Every move could be your last. Can you survive the virus and reassemble yourself before it\u2019s too late?</p>","developers":["ByteLyft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083150/c7d4082ae8ca026601da0d69a120b0fdc7ef2749/header.jpg?t=1760412357","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steams